{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3662770/extras/frogspin_title_01.png?t=1749631932\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3662770/extras/frogspin_gif_slots_v01_rounded_10px_edit.gif?t=1749631932\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hop into the world of <strong>FrogSpin</strong>, where a wind-up frog with big dreams takes center stage! Leap across dazzling fruit tiles, spin slot machines, and navigate unpredictable weather conditions and other chaotic modifiers. Every move is crucial! Utilizing simple two-button controls\u2014tapping for quick hops and holding for dramatic leaps\u2014you will guide the frog to glory. \ud83d\udc38\u2728</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3662770/extras/frogspin_features_01.png?t=1749631932\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3662770/extras/frogspin_gif_drill_rounded_10px.gif?t=1749631932\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Skill Meets Strategy:</strong> Master precision jumps or revel in hilarious missteps\u2014it\u2019s all part of the charm. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\ude97\u00a0<strong>Transformations:</strong> Dash as a toy car, float like a bubble, or smash through tiles with the power of a drill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf08 <strong>Adorable Visuals:</strong> Bright, cheerful, and irresistibly croak-worthy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfb0 <strong>Slot Machine Madness:</strong> Face randomly selected modifiers like slippery rain, gusty winds, balloon gravity, and more, making every level a unique challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Point Collecting Fun:</strong>\u00a0Rack up points and reap big rewards\u2014collecting shiny points has never been so satisfying!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfa9 <strong>Accessorize:</strong> Unlock quirky hats and accessories, some with unique powers. Use them across modes and showcase your froggy flair!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3662770/extras/frogspin_gamemodes_01.png?t=1749631932\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3662770/extras/frogspin_gif_gravity_rounded_10px.gif?t=1749631932\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfb2 <strong>Roulette Mode:</strong> Take on the ultimate roguelike challenge with limited lives and ever-changing levels. Each roll brings a new random level and a set of unpredictable modifiers, like wacky weather or unique effects that can ease or intensify the chaos.<br><br>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Training Mode:</strong> Play at your own pace with unlimited lives, unlocking and clearing levels as you go. For an extra challenge, aim to collect all the fruits in each level or beat your personal best times.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3662770?t=1749631932","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3662770/4249439950c3c72e0c3bffc5d36e3c0bdd34d30b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749631932","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3662770/cecd051f55a6730a793b83d6247170a3587a62b1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749631932","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3662770/cecd051f55a6730a793b83d624717